WEBVTT

00:47:27.404 --> 00:47:30.464
Our theme music
is by Allison Layton-Brown.

00:47:30.488 --> 00:47:33.334
Special thanks to
my colleague Michelle Quint.

00:47:33.954 --> 00:47:35.155
I’m Chris Anderson.

00:47:35.179 --> 00:47:37.013
Thanks so much for listening.

00:47:44.558 --> 00:47:45.723
On the next episode,

00:47:45.747 --> 00:47:48.830
MIT research scientist Andrew McAfee

00:47:48.854 --> 00:47:53.051
and the scary but exciting
future of our work lives,

00:47:53.075 --> 00:47:56.514
driven by the coming artificial
intelligence revolution.

00:47:56.538 --> 00:47:58.842
(Recording) Andrew McAfee:
I kind of believe that

00:47:58.866 --> 00:48:00.172
in the rest of my lifetime,